source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Every highlight as Markdown (the default) or JSON

Usage: mxr reading export [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --markdown           Markdown, ready for a notes app (the default)
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
